  "architectural_interpretation_boundary": "The 16-state MicrogridWithBESSPI architecture uses an idealized DC-bus current injection i_bess = p_bess_ref / Vdc (with Vdc ~ 340 V) and evaluates the 1RC Leaf 2p cell-pair model (V_t ~ 3.74 V) with that same scalar current for SoC/SoH/V_t state evolution. Consequently, Vdc/V_t ~ 91 is a documented scale warning (REVIEW for physical bank-to-bus energy equivalence until a series-parallel pack N_s x N_p and bidirectional DC/DC converter are specified), while DC-capacitor energy conservation Delta E_Cdc = int(P_pv + P_bess_dc - P_inv_dc) dt and 1RC internal power decomposition OCV*i = V_t*i + i^2*R0 + V_rc*i hold to machine precision.",
